Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Uninstall — removes the uBO force-install policy for Vivaldi. Run elevated, restart Vivaldi.
; Deletes only uBO's entry; other ExtensionSettings policies stay.
; Managed-device step is separate — run fake-mdm-undo.reg to undo that.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Vivaldi\ExtensionSettings]
"cbmpaamhmhdhnkofemgdlnbdadbpmjkn"=-

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Vivaldi]
"DeveloperToolsAvailability"=-
